<h3 class="govuk-heading-m">
  Pagination required
</h3>

<p class="govuk-body">
  When retrieving applications, pagination is required. The `page` and `per_page` parameters allows you to handle large volumes of applications in smaller, manageable batches

  Use the page parameter to retrieve the indicated page of results. The first call should ask for page 1. Use the links object in the response to navigate subsequent paginated results.

  Use the per_page parameter to specify how many applications to return per page. The default and maximum value is 50.

  To utilise pagination both page and per_page parameters must be specified.
</p>
